OL,5,G1700 The Early Music Show
OL,6,     FHannah French traces the life of
OL,7,     Fthe Italian castrato Francesco
OL,8,     FBernardi (otherwise known as
OL,9,     FSenesino), for whom Handel wrote
OL,10,     Fmany operatic roles during his
OL,11,     Ftime working in London.
OL,12,G1800 Choral Evensong
OL,13,     FLive from the Parish Church of St
OL,14,     FJohn-at-Hampstead, London, with
OL,15,     Fthe choir of Gonville and Caius
OL,16,     FCollege, Cambridge, to mark the
OL,17,     F100th anniversary of the death of
OL,18,     FCharles Wood.
