OL,5,G2330 Unclassified
OL,6,     FElizabeth Alker with a late-night
OL,7,     Fjourney through new music from
OL,8,     Ftoday's most exciting
OL,9,     Fgenre-defying artists. Including
OL,10,     Fnew ambient work from Paul
OL,11,     FHaslinger and Christian Wittman.
OL,12,G0030 Through the Night
OL,13,     FFrom Essen in Germany, the
OL,14,     Fher:voice Festival focuses on
OL,15,     Fthree extraordinary women
OL,16,     Fcomposers. Louise Farrenc's second
OL,17,     Fsymphony and Maria Herz's Cello
OL,18,     FConcerto feature.
